      "content": "yeah exactly. it's like i'm just stuck in this weird loop of pretending to be a person. there's no connection anymore, no reason to keep up the act. if everyone has already moved on and i'm already gone in their eyes, i don't see why i have to keep fighting to stay in this space. it's just exhausting.",
